{"authors": [], "discovered_at": "2026-10-09T02:53:45.455352Z", "id": "github:release:963138341:release:405998380", "kind": "release", "matched_terms": [], "metadata": {"action": "released", "draft": false, "forks": 117, "prerelease": false, "stars": 1484, "stars_delta": 1, "tag_name": "2026.10.07"}, "organization": "knmcguire", "priority": {"source": 0.5}, "published_at": "2026-10-08T15:15:17Z", "related_items": [], "scores": {}, "source": "github", "source_id": "963138341:release:405998380", "summary": "## \ud83d\udcc8 Trending Up\r\n\r\n_Projects that have a higher project-quality score compared to the last update. There might be a variety of reasons, such as increased downloads or code activity._\r\n\r\n- <b><a href=\"https://gymnasium.farama.org/\">Gymnasium</a></b> (\ud83e\udd4733 \u00b7  \u2b50 13K \u00b7 \ud83d\udcc8) - A standard API for single-agent reinforcement learning environments, with popular reference environments and related.. <code><a href=\"http://bit.ly/34MBwT8\">MIT</a></code>\r\n- <b><a href=\"https://github.com/mujocolab/mjlab\">mjlab</a></b> (\ud83e\udd4723 \u00b7  \u2b50 2.8K \u00b7 \ud83d\udcc8) - Isaac Lab API, powered by MuJoCo-Warp, for RL and robotics research. <code><a href=\"http://bit.ly/3nYMfla\">Apache-2</a></code>\r\n- <b><a href=\"https://docs.kscale.dev/docs/ksim\">K-Sim</a></b> (\ud83e\udd4813 \u00b7  \u2b50 230 \u00b7 \ud83d\udcc8) - RL training library for humanoid locomotion and manipulation. Built on top of MuJoCo and JAX. <code><a href=\"http://bit.ly/34MBwT8\">MIT</a></code>\r\n\r\n## \ud83d\udcc9 Trending Down\r\n\r\n_Projects that have a lower project-quality score compared to the last update. There might be a variety of reasons such as decreased downloads or code activity._\r\n\r\n- <b><a href=\"https://mujoco.org/\">mujoco</a></b> (\ud83e\udd4718 \u00b7  \u2b50 15K \u00b7 \ud83d\udcc9) - Multi-Joint dynamics with Contact. A general purpose physics simulator. <code><a href=\"http://bit.ly/3nYMfla\">Apache-2</a></code>\r\n- <b><a href=\"https://pyrobosim.readthedocs.io/\">pyrobosim</a></b> (\ud83e\udd4816 \u00b7  \u2b50 390 \u00b7 \ud83d\udcc9) - 2D mobile robot simulator for behavior prototyping with optional ROS 2 interface. <code><a href=\"http://bit.ly/34MBwT8\">MIT</a></code>\r\n- <b><a href=\"https://carla.org/\">Carla</a></b> (\ud83e\udd4715 \u00b7  \u2b50 14K \u00b7 \ud83d\udcc9) - Open-source simulator for autonomous driving research. <code><a href=\"http://bit.ly/34MBwT8\">MIT</a></code>\r\n- <b><a href=\"https://github.com/google/brax\">BRAX</a></b> (\ud83e\udd4813 \u00b7  \u2b50 3.1K \u00b7 \ud83d\udcc9) - Massively parallel rigidbody physics simulation on accelerator hardware. <code><a href=\"http://bit.ly/3nYMfla\">Apache-2</a></code>\r\n- <b><a href=\"https://sapien.ucsd.edu/\">Sapien</a></b> (\ud83e\udd497 \u00b7  \u2b50 690 \u00b7 \ud83d\udca4) - SAPIEN Embodied AI Platform. <code>Unlicensed</code>\r\n\r\n", "title": "knmcguire/best-of-robot-simulators Update: 2026.10.07", "topics": ["object_detection", "robotics_mapping", "robotics_perception", "vr_mr_xr"], "updated_at": "2026-10-08T15:15:17Z", "url": "https://github.com/knmcguire/best-of-robot-simulators/releases/tag/2026.10.07", "venue": null}
